<title>USA: Techdyne Inc receives $2 mln contract.</title>
<headline>Techdyne Inc receives $2 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>HIALEAH, Fla. 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Techdyne Inc said on Tuesday that it had received a $2 million contract with the customer service division of Telxon Corp.</p>
<p>The one-year contract, with four one-year options, is for turnkey assembly services for Telxon's field services organization, Techdyne said in a statement.</p>
<p>Techdyne Inc manufactures electro-mechanical and electronic components for data processing, telecommunications and inventory control.</p>
